{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes 30+ mins gameplay, allowing you to create a fundamental but sustainable tower city, and witness different sceneries across higher sky layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/about-the-game-en-1.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once gentle air above the ground turned harsh, people living in the under world have little faith in going out again. Attract the dwellers in the under world, see them starting a new life on this ever yielding tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect everything you need from the sky; build a skyward tower and make it flourish with infrastructure and decorations. From a small hanging settlement, to a thriving tower city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-1.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/skyward.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dwellers have gathered at the tower. Build the essential facilities to help them make a living on this tower. Use the resources to develop - build higher and higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-3.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/skies-3.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the tower goes up, the dwellers will enter different skies. The environment and scenes will change as the tower builds higher. The air is colder and thinner in higher sky, bringing you more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-2.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/balloon.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The logistics is crucial for survival and development. The dwellers need porters to deliver across all levels. Pipes and balloons can be used to help transport up and down, they\u2019re much faster than porters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-4.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/rain.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The weather is no going to be tolerant. It will test the dwellers with sandstorm, blizzard and unknown forces. But it\u2019s also a good chance to gather sand in a sandstorm. Prepare repair kits and protect your buildings from environmental damages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-5.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/brace.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every building is a burden on the tower. The farther it is to the tower, the more pressure it gives to the body of the tower. Far buildings are vulnerable, but they can be reinforced by braces. Use braces to support the buildings and broaden your building space.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387080?t=1742815102","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387080?t=1742815102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/d0a8acd41b52929f8f65f9365f874faab3e97486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742815102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/d0a8acd41b52929f8f65f9365f874faab3e97486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742815102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stay tuned for the latest news, please follow us:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TikTok:\u00a0@stargategamesinc</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twitter(X): @stargate_games</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord: Stargate Games</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes 30+ mins gameplay, allowing you to create a fundamental but sustainable tower city, and witness different sceneries across higher sky layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/about-the-game-en-1.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The once gentle air above the ground turned harsh, people living in the under world have little faith in going out again. Attract the dwellers in the under world, see them starting a new life on this ever yielding tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect everything you need from the sky; build a skyward tower and make it flourish with infrastructure and decorations. From a small hanging settlement, to a thriving tower city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-1.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/skyward.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dwellers have gathered at the tower. Build the essential facilities to help them make a living on this tower. Use the resources to develop - build higher and higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-3.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/skies-3.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the tower goes up, the dwellers will enter different skies. The environment and scenes will change as the tower builds higher. The air is colder and thinner in higher sky, bringing you more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-2.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/balloon.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The logistics is crucial for survival and development. The dwellers need porters to deliver across all levels. Pipes and balloons can be used to help transport up and down, they\u2019re much faster than porters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-4.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/rain.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The weather is no going to be tolerant. It will test the dwellers with sandstorm, blizzard and unknown forces. But it\u2019s also a good chance to gather sand in a sandstorm. Prepare repair kits and protect your buildings from environmental damages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/banner-en-5.png?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/extras/brace.gif?t=1742815102\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every building is a burden on the tower. The farther it is to the tower, the more pressure it gives to the body of the tower. Far buildings are vulnerable, but they can be reinforced by braces. Use braces to support the buildings and broaden your building space.</p>","developers":["Stargate Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3209750","name":"STARIO: Haven Tower"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387080/header.jpg?t=1742815102","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirement